# factory-dashboard — projector credential (copy to .env, chmod 600; .env is gitignored).
#
# The projector subscribes to the estate's APPMILLA-account subjects (pipeline.>, agents.>,
# fleet.>, deploy.>, $KV.agent-registry.>), so the URL must carry an APPMILLA user that may
# subscribe to them. Until the IN-3 `dashboard_ro` scoped identity exists (escrow-gated), that
# is a broad operator credential — a named register item, not a hidden one.
FACTORY_DASH_NATS_URL=nats://USER:PASSWORD@127.0.0.1:4222
